{
  "key": 25639,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Route11_EastEntrance_1F_Text_ManInLavenderRatesNames",
      "en_US": [
        "Don’t you think it’s hard to think\n",
        "up good names for Pokémon?\r",
        "Especially if you’ve caught a\n",
        "whole bunch?\r",
        "In Lavender Town, there’s a man\n",
        "who rates Pokémon nicknames.\r",
        "He can even help you rename your\n",
        "Pokémon, too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Route11_EastEntrance_1F_Text_RockTunnelToReachLavender",
      "en_US": [
        "If you’re aiming to reach Lavender\n",
        "Town, take Rock Tunnel.\r",
        "You can get to Rock Tunnel from\n",
        "Cerulean City."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Trade_Text_LookingForMonWannaTradeForMon",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m looking for the Pokémon\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Wanna trade one for my\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Trade_Text_HeyThanks",
      "en_US": "Hey, thanks!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Route11_EastEntrance_2F_Text_GiveItemfinderIfCaught30",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi! Remember me?\n",
        "I’m one of Prof. Oak’s Aides.\r",
        "If your Pokédex has complete data\n",
        "on {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} species, I’m supposed to\f",
        "give you a reward.\r",
        "Prof. Oak entrusted me with the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} for you.\r",
        "So, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, let me ask you.\r",
        "Have you gathered data on at least\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} kinds of Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Route11_EastEntrance_2F_Text_GreatHereYouGo",
      "en_US": [
        "Great! You have caught or owned\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} kinds of Pokémon!\r",
        "Congratulations!\n",
        "Here you go!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Route11_EastEntrance_2F_Text_ReceivedItemfinderFromAide",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}\n",
        "from the Aide."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Route11_EastEntrance_2F_Text_ExplainItemfinder",
      "en_US": [
        "There are items on the ground that\n",
        "may be hidden from view.\r",
        "Use the Itemfinder to detect any\n",
        "hidden items close to you.\r",
        "The machine is a bit limited.\n",
        "It can’t pinpoint item locations.\r",
        "What it does is show the direction\n",
        "where the item is.\r",
        "Use it to get your bearings, then\n",
        "search the suspect area by hand."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Route11_EastEntrance_2F_Text_BigMonAsleepOnRoad",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s see what the binoculars have\n",
        "to show…\r",
        "A big Pokémon is asleep on a road!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Route11_EastEntrance_2F_Text_RockTunnelGoodRouteToLavender",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s see what the binoculars have\n",
        "to show…\r",
        "To get to Lavender Town from\n",
        "Cerulean City…\r",
        "Rock Tunnel appears to be a good\n",
        "route to take."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Trade_Text_IsntMyOldMonGreat",
      "en_US": "Isn’t my old {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} great?"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Trade_Text_AwwOhWell",
      "en_US": [
        "Awww!\n",
        "Oh, well…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Trade_Text_WhatThatsNoMon",
      "en_US": [
        "What?\n",
        "That’s no {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Aide_Text_GetEnoughMonsComeBackForItem",
      "en_US": [
        "…Oh. I see.\r",
        "When you get {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} kinds of Pokémon,\n",
        "come back for the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Aide_Text_HaventCaughtEnoughMonsForItem",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s see…\n",
        "Uh-oh! You have caught only\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} kinds of Pokémon!\r",
        "You need {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} kinds\n",
        "if you want the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Aide_Text_DontHaveAnyRoomForItem",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! I see you don’t have any\n",
        "room for the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_Route11_EastEntrance_2F_Text_WhatABreathtakingView",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s see what the binoculars have\n",
        "to show…\r",
        "What a breathtaking view!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0347_R11R0101_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
